special: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  As an Instant Maneuver, you may spend a stack of Battle Born to use the Power Up Maneuver.
text: >
  As an Instant Maneuver, you may spend a stack of Battle Born to use the Power Up Maneuver.
  –Maneuver Type: Instant Maneuver
  –Action Cost: N/A
  –KP Cost: N/A (a stack of Battle Born)
  –Effect: Use the Power Up Maneuver.

---

